# Local settings for the integration tests in tests/integration/.
#
# Copy this file to tests/local.env (gitignored) and fill it in with your own
# games. It is sourced by the scripts as shell, so values are shell words; a
# variable left unset makes the tests that need it skip. Nothing here is ever
# committed: the ids name games from your own collection, and the paths are
# your own machine's.

# Where your disc images and archives are. Default: iso/ in the checkout.
KRETRO_ISO_DIR="$HOME/games/images"

# Where the manifests for those games are. Default: games/ in the checkout.
# KRETRO_MANIFESTS="$HOME/games/manifests"

# Game ids, by manifest name, that install without a person: method "copy" or
# "unzip", with the disc named by `iso`. install.sh installs the first;
# bundle.sh installs every one whose disc is here and builds a player of them.
# Two or more also test that damage to one game in a player spares the others.
KRETRO_TEST_GAMES="example-game other-game"

# install.sh's game, when it should not be the first of KRETRO_TEST_GAMES.
# KRETRO_TEST_INSTALL_GAME="example-game"

# What scan.sh must find in KRETRO_ISO_DIR: one line per file, its name and
# its disc count, tab-separated. Default: tests/local/expected-collection.txt.
# KRETRO_TEST_COLLECTION="tests/local/expected-collection.txt"

# portability.sh runs this player instead of building a tiny one, and plays
# this game in it.
# KRETRO_PLAYER="$HOME/players/classics.run"
# KRETRO_PLAYER_GAME="example-game"
